{
  "tab": "drop_tables",
  "note": "NOTE: drop_rate is a percent (25 = 25%, 0.5 = 0.5%). Each row is an independent roll. v0.1.2: every rate doubled after playtest (capped at 90%), relative rarity unchanged. Bands now: copper ~70%; category essences 40-60% (qty 1-3; bosses 80%, 2-5). Monster Essence ~30%; Training Scroll ~12%. Material bands: commons 30-40%; uncommons 2-6%; crystals / Holy Essence / Soul Shard / Log ~0.6-2%; Heartwood boss-only ~4-10%; gear ~0.1-0.4%; ultra-rares ~0.02-0.1%. Healing and MP drinks are NOT on every monster — only overlapping subsets of thematically related ones, at low rates. Quantities (min_qty-max_qty, rolled weighted toward the low end): copper 1-4, essences 1-3, Monster Essence 1-2, common materials 1-3, uncommon materials 1-2, rares/gear/consumables/junk 1. Mid curios and rare high-sell junk are shared by 2-3 related monsters. unlock_requirement_id is optional (e.g. unlock_cursed_dust).",
